{
  "name": "Legion of One",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You can use a Bonus Action to create two echoes with your Manifest Echo feature, and these echoes can coexist. If you try to create a third echo, the previous two echoes are destroyed. Anything you can do from one echo's position can be done from the other's instead.</p><p>In addition, when you roll initiative and have no uses of your Unleash Incarnation feature left, you regain one use of that feature.</p>",
